## Scripts

| Script | Description |
|--------|-------------|
| `start:dev` | Start the development server with reload (`avleon serve`) |
| `build`     | Compile TypeScript to `dist/` (`avleon build`) |
| `start`     | Run the compiled app in production (`avleon start`) |
